From e277bbbff9b5f570415325ceaded4595fa71c1bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yimiaozhu <yimiaozhu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 10:54:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add AdaptiveHIT training/prediction integration for DrugBAN

- main_integ_drugban.py: training entrypoint used by the AdaptiveHIT
  pipeline
- predict_drugban.py / predict_drugban_em.py: standalone prediction
  entrypoints via a new trainer.Predicter class (the _em variant
  additionally dumps fused co-attention features for downstream ensemble
  use)
- trainer.py: extend Trainer with per-epoch val+test evaluation/logging
  (evaluates and saves results every epoch instead of only at the end)
  and add the new Predicter class for standalone inference
- dataloader.py: add a defensive check/logging for invalid SMILES and
  negative virtual-node counts
- configs.py: tune MAX_EPOCH (100 -> 50) for the AdaptiveHIT training run
---
